Here's a macro that can be used:

dndrandomizer.generateDynamicEncounter("Single BBEG","Treasure Horde","Variety of","deadly",150,300,5);

Here's an implementation that uses a Monk's Tile Trigger. Using a tile with "Run as Macro" i pass the circle radius as arg (the tile is already passed by Monk's Tile)

dndrandomizer.generateDynamicEncounter("Single BBEG","Treasure Horde","Variety of","deadly",tile.x,tile.y,args[0]);

